      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "5-fluoro-uracil (5-FU) cardiotoxicity has been often reported during chemotherapy. We collect four atypical cases of cardiac side effects in patients treated by 5-FU for head and neck tumors. We review the literature about the subject, and we propose criteria to detect patients with a high risk level, and to prevent this adverse effect incidence."},
